A child's margin reaches fyne in a box that says nothing else.

- A box one of whose children has a margin is `fynelayout.New`'s, which
  insets each child by its own: built as Fyne's box, which knows no margin,
  the margin was dropped. A child's flex and size already made it so.

deny out/go/fyne/model.go `container\.NewVBox\(\)` -- the column holding a margined child is no Fyne box

-- app.sngl --
import ui "sngl:ui"

output {
    go {
        fyne
    }
}

ui.window {
    ui.vbox {
        ui.text(value="inset", style={margin=8px})
        ui.text(value="beside it")
    }
}
-- out/go/fyne/model.go --
